    "describe_ch": "本課程主要內容與進行方式為專題演講與討論。協助研究生擴展學術視野、強化研究方法認知並訓練相關簡報技巧。",
    "describe_eh": "The main content and activity of this course is to provide graduate students with seminars and discussions, through which assists students to broaden academic vision, to promote research capability, as well as to strengthen report training.",
